{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The suffocating rocks of the caves are slowly closing in to claim another soul. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Keep crawling... </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eventually, a passageway has to open up...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About the Demo</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cave Diver Demo introduces you to a segment of the cave that has been unexplored for decades. Here you will learn to maneuver throughout this claustrophobic maze of rock using only your two hands. Learn to perfect these punishing controls, and discover the remnants of old caving journals left by explorers who failed to navigate these unforgiving caverns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the unconventional controls, twisted caverns, and claustrophobic horror for yourself in this demo of The Cave Diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About The Cave Diver</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crawl through claustrophobic tunnels and unforgiving detours.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/08483dd5e3d28fdfbf47f06f0fe71929.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/08483dd5e3d28fdfbf47f06f0fe71929.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/08483dd5e3d28fdfbf47f06f0fe71929.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caves are a labyrinth of crushing stones and constricting passageways. Branching tunnels will lure you into claustrophobic dead-ends where turning back is physically impossible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Map out the cave system through multiple attempts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/cd866d216d5b4b2e58efb6e3c98f12b2.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/cd866d216d5b4b2e58efb6e3c98f12b2.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/cd866d216d5b4b2e58efb6e3c98f12b2.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer crude signs into the stone to track your descent into the caves. With every new body, the cave grows familiar. The marks of those who came before remain\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't get stuck.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/8d0e2020d53dd31f0fe314e36e53d81f.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/8d0e2020d53dd31f0fe314e36e53d81f.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/8d0e2020d53dd31f0fe314e36e53d81f.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caves are no place for the living. Getting stuck means dying alone, entombed in rock. No one is coming to save you. When you return as a new cave diver, you might stumble upon your predecessor's decayed remains - if you can reach them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn to move through physical puzzles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/6f1d63be42796f1357be6a20449ad328.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/6f1d63be42796f1357be6a20449ad328.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/6f1d63be42796f1357be6a20449ad328.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the movement and grip of your two hands to carefully navigate obstacles and overcome physics puzzles. Every movement is perfected through failure. Only the obsessive, the patient, and the insane make it deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover what horrors lie deep underground.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/c447461217d0e921a436fd4e31c5b7da.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/c447461217d0e921a436fd4e31c5b7da.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/c447461217d0e921a436fd4e31c5b7da.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations your family has told stories of a rare flower that grows at the bottom of these caves. They say the flower can cure any ailment - even paraplegia of the legs . But every man who's entered the caves has failed to return... Some say the cave itself takes them... Others speak of something ancient that stirs below - an evil older than man himself...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928440?t=1755312668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/c01a72a0b8f1ac71f28b5094e5974c23ff44c70b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755312668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/a5c86cc2833a54e1b4ad61068e5445483e13933e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755312668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/a5c86cc2833a54e1b4ad61068e5445483e13933e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755312668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game contains stylized depictions of tight spaces, bodily injury, panic attacks, violence and gore. Text includes crude language and references to drugs, violence, and mental episodes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The suffocating rocks of the caves are slowly closing in to claim another soul. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Keep crawling... </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eventually, a passageway has to open up...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About the Demo</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cave Diver Demo introduces you to a segment of the cave that has been unexplored for decades. Here you will learn to maneuver throughout this claustrophobic maze of rock using only your two hands. Learn to perfect these punishing controls, and discover the remnants of old caving journals left by explorers who failed to navigate these unforgiving caverns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the unconventional controls, twisted caverns, and claustrophobic horror for yourself in this demo of The Cave Diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About The Cave Diver</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crawl through claustrophobic tunnels and unforgiving detours.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/08483dd5e3d28fdfbf47f06f0fe71929.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/08483dd5e3d28fdfbf47f06f0fe71929.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/08483dd5e3d28fdfbf47f06f0fe71929.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caves are a labyrinth of crushing stones and constricting passageways. Branching tunnels will lure you into claustrophobic dead-ends where turning back is physically impossible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Map out the cave system through multiple attempts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/cd866d216d5b4b2e58efb6e3c98f12b2.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/cd866d216d5b4b2e58efb6e3c98f12b2.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/cd866d216d5b4b2e58efb6e3c98f12b2.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer crude signs into the stone to track your descent into the caves. With every new body, the cave grows fami