ake it deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover what horrors lie deep underground.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/c447461217d0e921a436fd4e31c5b7da.poster.avif?t=1755312668\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/c447461217d0e921a436fd4e31c5b7da.webm?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/extras/c447461217d0e921a436fd4e31c5b7da.mp4?t=1755312668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations your family has told stories of a rare flower that grows at the bottom of these caves. They say the flower can cure any ailment - even paraplegia of the legs . But every man who's entered the caves has failed to return... Some say the cave itself takes them... Others speak of something ancient that stirs below - an evil older than man himself...</p>","developers":["Ovsko"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3004390","name":"The Cave Diver"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928440/f0df4b9e744b8ee107be2f4be2f6b7354774ddf9/header.jpg?t=1755312668","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, businesses, places, events and incidents are either the products of the author's imagination or used in a fictitious manner. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257180933,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180933/movie480.mp4?t=1755101639","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st